{
  "packet": 5,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"纸箱最多能装两个人，也就是可以和CO-OPS伙伴一起钻进去。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"要怎么做！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"靠近伙伴藏身的纸箱，直到图标出现，再按<I=ACT>即可。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_CONTROL_PRESERVED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"按住<I=ACT>期间不会离开纸箱。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_CONTROL_PRESERVED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"和蛇形编队一样。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"没错。在Snake IN状态下套上纸箱，两个人也会一起进入同一个纸箱。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"能和信赖的伙伴一起钻纸箱……真是个好时代啊，对吧，Kaz？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0176F0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"啊、啊。是啊……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，研发班做出了这么个东西……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这是！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"纸箱坦克。和其他纸箱一样，可以两个人一起套进去。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"前面的人当驾驶员，后面的人当炮手，据说还能发射炮弹……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"喂，Kaz。这是谁开发的？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对、对不起，Boss。他也不是存心胡闹。不过再怎么说，也不可能有人把这东西错看成坦克……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"太棒了！！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"啊？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"隐蔽性与攻击力的完美结合，粗犷的设计也很好。这才叫完美设计！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Kaz，带我去见做出它的人，我要亲自道谢。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"你、你是认真的？Snake。这不管怎么看都……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"怎么看都是杰作。难道你看不出来？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"S、Snake！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"哇，好漂亮的坦克。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Paz！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":15,"cn_text":"虽然我讨厌坦克，但这个好像能让我喜欢上。它不排废气，这样就不会污染哥斯达黎加的森林了。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":16,"cn_text":"什么！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Kaz，干得好。让你担任副司令果然没错。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","unique_index":18,"cn_text":"怎、怎么会……是我……是我不正常吗！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0182D0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"真的！？","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0182D0","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我偏爱现场录音，所以一直觉得只能播放的便携设备很可笑。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"高兴吧，Snake！速食咖喱开发成功了！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"你说什么！？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"开发起来很辛苦。毕竟唯一的线索，就是美军口粮使用了真空包装香肠这条情报。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"听说最困难的是调整灭菌处理时的温度与压力，为此反复试验了许多次。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"蒸煮袋是连太空食品都会用到的技术，竟能独立开发出来，我们的人员真有本事。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"马上尝尝吧，现在把包装……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"等等，Snake！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"怎么？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"这东西要先用沸水加热再吃。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是吗。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"要等三分钟。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Kaz，三分钟到了！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"忍字头上一把刀……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_CULTURAL_ADAPTATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"好香。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯，好吃！这真不错啊，Snake！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我也这么觉得，味道很好。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"蔬菜的甜味融进咖喱酱里……太美妙了，简直像刚出锅一样。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"没想到在战场上还能吃到这么美味的东西。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"好，决定了！它就叫“Bon Curry”！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……顺带一提，“BON”在法语里是“好”或“美味”的意思。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"为什么偏偏用法语？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"这个嘛……我很向往巴黎姑娘……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019000","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"随你吧。不过“Bon Curry”……听起来不坏。这可是口粮的革命。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你喜欢墨西哥薄饼吗，Snake？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么突然说起这个？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那是用玉米粉制作的中美洲代表性食物之一，我在美国时就很喜欢。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这个我知道。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"要是随时都能享用那股焦香……你不这么想吗，Snake？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"任务期间不可能，也保存不了。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"别急着放弃。研发班开发出了可以保存的玉米片，就是把薄饼切成三角形后油炸。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我们决定叫它“Doritos”。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"Doritos？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0194B0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"西班牙语意为“小金块”，因为炸出来是漂亮的金黄色。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"任务期间不缺饮料吧？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不缺，还有马黛茶。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"马黛茶啊……那也不错，不过你不会想喝点碳酸饮料吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"当然想，可任务期间不能奢求。我们又不是在时代广场附近逛街。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"别失望，Snake。研发班为我们开发了一种新的碳酸饮料。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"名叫“Mountain Dew”！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"山间露水，Mountain Dew。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对。这是以大自然为意象、带有柑橘风味的清爽饮料，碳酸不太强，累的时候也能畅快地喝。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"}
  ]
}
